    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L07-ACTIVITY-007",
      "SourceSection": "7.3: An Even Better Fit",
      "SourceExcerpt": "In an earlier lesson, we looked at the temperature \\(T\\), in degrees Fahrenheit, of a bottle of soda water left outside for \\(h\\) hours. Let’s model this data with a function. This time, we will start with the function \\(f(h) =…",
