    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L07-ACTIVITY-011",
      "SourceSection": "7.3: An Even Better Fit",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Han tried the following steps to model the soda water temperature. First he shifts the given graph left by one hour, then he applies a vertical shift.",
