    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U05-L07-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "7.3: An Even Better Fit",
      "SourceExcerpt": "What vertical shift does Han need to apply to model the 45 degree Fahrenheit temperature in the refrigerator?",
